      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-83ee3b6ae7",
          "answer": "Large tuberosity posterior, cuboid facet anterior, talar facets superior; sustentaculum tali projects medially. Flexor hallucis longus groove lies beneath sustentaculum.",
